IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il31-nouns`
IMPORT `il31-ito66-vintages`
IMPORT `ito-il03-nouns`
IMPORT `il31-ito121b-2025`

-- INDEPENDENT TESTS for BACKLOG IL-31, by fid-il-31.
-- Every expected value is from DECIDED-ANSWERS.md (sha256 fa8af1300b4c422842e26d8a0df0f6725cfe1c2df1be20896c4f060ffa738b5b),
-- written from the Hebrew page images before the encoding was opened. The case id is on the line above each assertion.
-- Nothing here was changed to match the encoding.
--
-- EXPECTED FAILURES AND REFUSALS (declared in check.sh; each is named here):
--   * D16 (tax year 2024, s 121B): DECIDED said (a1) = 0 and the (a) charge applies; the entry point REFUSES.
--     Asserted here as my decided value; it is an expected failure (class TESTER-WRONG / AMBIGUITY, see INDEPENDENT-FINDINGS.md).
--   * B07 default (child born 2009, SH 2972, no reading named): DECIDED says out (0, confidence M) and flags the
--     ambiguity; the encoding declines by default. The default call is asserted as a REFUSAL (expected refusal that holds),
--     and the reading named is asserted as 0.
--   * Not callable (no entry point): A30, A31 (election of (4)(a1)), B10, B11 (s 40(c) single parents), D13 (timing
--     of income produced or received), D19 to D21 (2026 onward, IL-03), C01 to C13 except the dates asserted below.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

`the woman` MEANS `a woman, under paragraph (4)`
`the man` MEANS `a man, under paragraph (5)`
`not a toddler` MEANS FALSE

GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A child in section 66(c)`
`a child born in tax year` b MEANS
    `A child in section 66(c)` WITH `tax year of birth` IS b

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`ind salary` n MEANS
    `An item of income` WITH
        `amount`                                                               IS n
        `from personal exertion`                                               IS TRUE
        `under section 2(1) or 2(2)`                                           IS TRUE
        `charged at the rates in section 121`                                  IS TRUE
        `subject to a duty to keep books of account, and acceptable books were not kept` IS FALSE
        `inflationary amount, as defined in section 88`                        IS 0

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`ind pension` n MEANS
    `An item of income` WITH
        `amount`                                                               IS n
        `from personal exertion`                                               IS TRUE
        `under section 2(1) or 2(2)`                                           IS FALSE
        `charged at the rates in section 121`                                  IS TRUE
        `subject to a duty to keep books of account, and acceptable books were not kept` IS FALSE
        `inflationary amount, as defined in section 88`                        IS 0

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An item of income`
`ind capital` n MEANS
    `An item of income` WITH
        `amount`                                                               IS n
        `from personal exertion`                                               IS FALSE
        `under section 2(1) or 2(2)`                                           IS FALSE
        `charged at the rates in section 121`                                  IS FALSE
        `subject to a duty to keep books of account, and acceptable books were not kept` IS FALSE
        `inflationary amount, as defined in section 88`                        IS 0

GIVEN v IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A sale of a right in real estate`
`ind residential sale` v `betterment` b MEANS
    `A sale of a right in real estate` WITH
        `betterment`                                                                    IS b
        `inflationary amount, as defined in section 47 of the Real Estate Taxation Law` IS 0
        `in a residential apartment`                                                    IS TRUE
        `sale value`                                                                    IS v
        `exempt from tax under any law`                                                 IS FALSE

GIVEN y     IS A NUMBER
      items IS A LIST OF `An item of income`
      sales IS A LIST OF `A sale of a right in real estate`
GIVETH AN `An individual in a tax year`
`ind person in` y `with` items `and` sales MEANS
    `An individual in a tax year` WITH
        `tax year`                       IS y
        `date of birth`                  IS YMD 1980 6 15
        `items of income`                IS items
        `sales of rights in real estate` IS sales

-- T for 2025: 721,560 (DECIDED-ANSWERS 0.4: consolidation note, frozen by s 120B(e)(1)).
`ind T` MEANS 721_560

