-- D24: residential sale value 6,000,000, betterment 3,000,000: (a) 3% x 2,278,440 = 68,353.2; (a1) 45,568.8; total 113,922.
#ASSERT `the additional tax under section 121B in tax year 2025 for` (`ind person in` 2025 `with` (EMPTY) `and` (LIST `ind residential sale` 6_000_000 `betterment` 3_000_000)) `, with the amount in section 121B(a) at` `ind T` EQUALS RIGHT 113_922
