#ASSERT `the additional tax under section 121B in tax year 2025 for` (`ind person in` 2025 `with` (LIST `ind salary` 2_200_000, `ind capital` 800_000) `and` (EMPTY)) `, with the amount in section 121B(a) at` `ind T` EQUALS RIGHT 69_922
